[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i366"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天，我一大早就来到了海之家。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想趁静久来之前，和紬聊一聊昨天的事情。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14517"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“～～～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“早上好，紬。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14380"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾！早上好，羽依里先生。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14446"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“快看！今天冲上岸来好多玩偶呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇，还真是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“它们都会成为我的朋友哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，我来帮你搬吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14470"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“非常感谢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后，我有些事想和你说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14467"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"关于之前我们两个人从静久身上感到的不自然。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把这件事跟她说了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是从镜子阿姨那里听来的那些事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为童年时发生的事情，静久可能被神明选为了新娘。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因此，不愉快的记忆会悉数消失。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把这些都告诉了她。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14529"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哦……原来是这么回事啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前不自然的感觉得以化解，紬连连点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然了，前提是全盘相信镜子阿姨所说的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬，你相信这种超自然的事情吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14522"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我知道确实会有这种事，但原理还是一个谜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也就是说没有彻底相信吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14377"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不过，静久确实忘记了很多事情呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有什么好办法呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们两个人都在苦恼。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14450"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾！羽依里先生，我有个好主意。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14564"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“羽依里先生，要不要在猫咪面前和静久结婚呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14473"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“就是让静久在成为神明的新娘之前，先成为羽依里先生的新娘。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦？哦哦……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14475"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这样的话，神明就要从羽依里先生那里抢新娘了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14423"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“神明一定不会做这么不讲理的事情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14461"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这样事情就解决啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原、原来如此！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是，这样做的话……她的记忆就不会再消失了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14460"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这个我也不清楚。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来你也不清楚啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14508"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“但一定没问题的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14510"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我也会向神明多多祈愿的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14473"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“只要不断祈愿，愿望就一定会实现。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14461"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是不是非常值得一试呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……或许吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“只要是能做的事情，我都想试试看。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14554"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“就是这个气势！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14470"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那么，等静久来了就向她求婚吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14489"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还没做好心理准备……求婚的台词也还没想好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这都是很重要的事情。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14510"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“在她来之前加油想吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，喔……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“等静久来了，我会自然而然地走掉躲起来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14445"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“等到那时，就向她求婚吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好、好的。我会加油的。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i366"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“早上好，你们两个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14469"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“早上好！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久也来了，于是我们三个一起打开了海之家的大门。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i365"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“羽依里，你怎么了？表情好有意思哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为发生了很多事，而且还要做很多事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以，就下意识变成这样的表情了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这样啊，要做很多事呢。我很期待哦♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说到这里，我马上就有件事想跟你说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13852"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，什么事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然不知道你会不会相信。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13891"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我相信♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好快。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13933"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我们不是说好了不会说谎吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好吧，确实是这样。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i365"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是，我向静久解释了一下情况。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当然，没有告诉她被母亲狠狠训斥的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也没有告诉她遭受很多人嫉恨的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大概就是这样。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13876"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“原来在我身上……发生了这么不得了的事呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？你相信吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13894"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯。因为羽依里和紬都说得那么认真。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“比起自己的记忆，我更愿意相信你们哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不愧是静久。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“而且呢……仔细想想也确实有这种感觉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“虽然不清楚自己能不能发自内心地相信，但我就选择相信吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“静久，谢谢你！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13962"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这话应该是我说才对吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13861"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过，能忘记不愉快的事情……总觉得，就像是在耍赖呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这其中还有些她本人不知情的原因。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13913"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，我该做些什么呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“最简单的，就是不要再来这个岛了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这个不行♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13832"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我还想和羽依里还有紬在岛上多多玩耍呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是……说不行就不行，你说得也太轻巧了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13746"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，是你们两个想得太沉重了啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13939"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这样想吧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13938"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“在暑假发生的一场，为女孩解除记忆诅咒的的大冒险。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13900"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“就是这种感觉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14395"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“有点小激动呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13933"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“对吧？我们就照这样的感觉，玩得开心一点吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明明是自己的事却沉得住气，静久你还真是厉害啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“因为没什么实际感受嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13832"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“而且我一点都不厉害。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13770"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“厉害的只有奶子而已。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13927"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这我倒是深有体会。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那确实很厉害。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“还想到了其他什么主意吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14467"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我给了紬一个眼神。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14532"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来她明白了。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14448"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不好意思……静久，羽依里先生。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13779"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14404"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我要去上补习班了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是所谓的自然而然地走掉……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"恐怕马上就会被识破吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14524"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那我先回去啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13832"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14522"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“说谎是？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“禁止的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13823"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“补习班呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14404"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“没有。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13813"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我不回去了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14530"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"收到了一个“失败了”的眼神。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“静久。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“羽依里，你知道紬为什么说谎吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要不要和我结婚？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13927"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13876"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请和我结婚吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13800"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们结婚吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13876"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎哎哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13761"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14445"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我觉得你们很适合结婚。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我会让你幸福的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i385"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13887"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我会很幸福的♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎哎哎哎哎哎哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13922"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那么，我们结婚吧♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没想到会得到这样的回答。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？哎？哎？这样真的可以吗!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13925"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13955"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你会让我幸福的对吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯、嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久虽然这么说，但她毕竟出奇地敏锐。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13963"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这肯定是为了避免我的记忆出问题，你们想出的办法吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然被她发现了。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i365"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14518"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13924"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13810"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“也是哦，以羽依里的年龄，在法律上是结不了婚的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13894"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“既然是你们两个想出的办法，那我就同意吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“老实说，我也不知道能不能成功。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13930"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没关系的。反正也能留下些美好的回忆，总之先试试看吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，就这么办。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13898"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过，我还是有点吃惊呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大概我才是更吃惊的那个。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13782"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“谢谢你们两个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“嗯！是我提出的建议！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13832"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“谢谢你啦，紬。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14435"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“哎嘿嘿～”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13938"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不过因为说谎了，等会儿要接受惩罚哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14489"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“婚礼……该怎么办呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14547"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“先宣誓爱情……然后就要接吻了呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13837"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎……在紬的面前？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个……果真还是有点……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13884"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“好害羞……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好害羞啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14524"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是这样吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14534"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我夏天结束之后就要回去了……所以……想着应该是看不到你们两位的婚礼了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“所以，你们这次的婚礼……我本来是非常期待的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14404"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13752"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我明白了……为了紬我要加油！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13879"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“对吧，羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……哎、哎哎!؟明白了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13855"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“太好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14553"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“两位，就是这种气势！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14547"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那么，我们去通知大家吧～”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13864"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14545"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“只有三个人的话太寂寞了。所以叫大家也都来参加吧～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不只是在紬的面前吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14425"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不，不是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14446"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13911"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是要在大家面前。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……真的假的。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11859"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13775"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14467"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“嗯？鹰原和水织前辈，还有紬也在啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“今天你们不用去海之家那边吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，因为天气太热了，也没有太多想吃咖喱的人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“反倒是她那边刨冰卖得特别好，看起来正忙着呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“里面传来沙沙的声响。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14377"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“野村，我想拜托你一件事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11689"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“可以来参加静久和羽依里先生的婚礼吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11884"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“但是，鹰原应该还没到能结婚的年龄吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我觉得她的反应可以再惊讶一点。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，这方面倒是没问题。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11877"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我向野美希简单解释了一下情况。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“原来如此。水织学姐要成为神明的新娘……吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我听说过这个传闻。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13881"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11877"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“这座岛并不大，就算是奇奇怪怪的事情也会迅速传开。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11889"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“所以，为了不让她成为神明的新娘，才要举行婚礼……吗。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10118"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“什么？你们在说什么呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，为了不让静久成为神明的新娘，我们在拜托大家帮忙呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎，是这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11868"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说是找人帮忙，但主要还是要靠鹰原努力吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这样没错。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不让她成为神明新娘的方法啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10308"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“神明喜欢纯洁之身……又说要靠羽依里努力……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10316"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10267"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“意、意思就是……那个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“水织学姐的对象是羽依里没错吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13796"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是、是的……虽然有些不好意思，但确实是这样的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10135"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是、是这样啊……接下来，水织学姐和羽依里就要……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10205"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你、你这家伙！务必要加油啊……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？啊，谢谢。”"},{"op":"set","variable":484,"value":32},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13932"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“其实，我也想邀请空门同学参加。”"},{"op":"set","variable":484,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10179"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哎？哎哎哎哎哎!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14464"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“当然我也会参加的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10176"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13923"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“小美希，你可以参加吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11746"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“当然可以。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10138"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“当然可以以以以以以!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10135"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“给我等一下，紬还有野美希也等一下！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14528"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾？怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11754"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这也太污秽不堪了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你这吐槽我还是第一次听说。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11889"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14530"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i10301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“但、但是……如果非要做……的话……我也可以豁出去――”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11775"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11724"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“啊啊……我大概……明白是怎么回事了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14522"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“怎么回事？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11886"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“为了苍的名誉着想，还是不要问了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13813"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11689"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“总之，我和苍都会参加。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i10138"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“野美希!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我去通知一下良一和天善。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i10261"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“说出了好惊人的话啊――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“苍……待会儿我再解释，你先冷静一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":769,"image":"i10135"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“解、解释……？野美希你对这档子事很了解吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11874"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原，还有紬，具体安排决定好之后再联系我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“知道了。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本来还想再多叫几个人的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过白羽似乎要准备岛上的活动，应该没什么时间参加。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥挺上道的，感觉她会愿意参加，于是我就去找了找。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但最终，还是没能找到神出鬼没的她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"能通知到的也就只有这几个人，所以今天大家就暂且解散了。"},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i514"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":4},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……不过，在回去的路上。"},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i85"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":4},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“喂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“我听他们说了，你要和水织会长举办模拟婚礼是吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“我也来参加。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？德田你也要来？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“没错，德田要来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谢谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“就这点表示؟!我可是德田啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然没表现出来，但在心里可是开起了德田庆典呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他信了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且还害羞了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，你为什么想来？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“因为这是件值得庆祝的事啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你还真意外地是个好人啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“而且就像之前说的，我很尊敬水织会长。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"德田","text":"“就算是模拟婚礼，我也想去为她庆祝一下。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想起镜子阿姨提到过的静久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她容易招人嫉妒，遭受到了不少妒忌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然也有像白羽那样跟静久不太合得来的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但也有像德田这样转而尊敬她的人啊。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]